{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02253","headline":"杂曲歌辞 宫中行乐词 八 · 李白","name":"杂曲歌辞 宫中行乐词 八","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"水绿南薰殿，花红北阙楼。\n莺歌闻太液，凤吹遶瀛洲。\n素女鸣珠佩，天人弄彩球。\n今朝风日好，宜入未央游。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02253.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02253","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}